                <pb facs="1322" n="1198" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg1198"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.674/36: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the High Commissioner at Constantinople</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bristol</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-01-10T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10,
                                1924—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>9. Your telegram 340 of December 31. Your recommendation approved. You should
                    keep in mind, however, that the question is one in which a large body of our
                    citizens is interested directly or indirectly. It would be desirable if
                    possible, therefore, for you to arrange the <hi rendition="#italic">modus
                        vivendi</hi> to which you referred in your final sentence.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
